      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roscommon%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every year since 1979, Roscommon hosts Michigan's Firemen's Memorial Festival to honor firefighters who died protecting communities.",
